            "mode": "override",
            "path": "system.attributes.hp.negativeHealing",
            "value": true
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Devastating Strikes",
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "Kharostan's melee Strikes ignore 10 points of a creature's resistance to physical damage.",
      "rules": [
        {
          "key": "note",
          "selector": "melee-strike-damage",
          "text": "{item|system.description.value}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Furious Sprint",
      "actions": 2,
      "category": "offensive",
      "traits": [
        "rage"
      ],
      "text": "Kharostan Strides up to five times his Speed in a straight line. He can increase the number of actions for this activity to 3 in order to Stride up to eight times his Speed in a straight line instead."
    },
    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Rage",
      "actions": 1,
      "category": "offensive",
      "traits": [
        "concentrate",
        "emotion",
        "mental"
      ],
      "text": "Requirements Kharostan isn't Fatigued or raging\n\n---\nEffect Kharostan gains 30 temporary Hit Points that last until the rage ends. While raging, he deals an additional 12 damage with melee attacks and takes a -1 penalty to AC.\n\nKharostan can't use concentrate actions except Seek and actions with the rage trait. The rage lasts for 1 minute, until there are no enemies Kharostan can perceive, or until Kharostan falls Unconscious. Once the rage ends, Kharostan can't again for 1 minute.",
      "rules": [
        {
          "key": "modifier",
          "selector": "ac",
          "type": "untyped",
          "value": -1,
          "when": [
            "self:effect:rage"
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "modifier",
          "selector": "melee-strike-damage",
          "type": "untyped",
          "value": 12,
          "when": [
            "self:effect:rage"
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "unsupported",
          "foundry": {
            "key": "ActiveEffectLike",
            "mode": "override",
            "path": "flags.system.rageTempHP",
            "value": 30
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Reckless Abandon",
      "actions": "free",
      "category": "offensive",
      "traits": [
        "rage"
      ],
      "text": "Trigger Kharostan's turn begins and he has 140 or fewer Hit Points\n\n---\n\nEffect Kharostan throws caution to the wind to finish the fight. He gains a +2 status bonus to attack rolls, a -2 status penalty to AC, and a -1 status penalty to saves. He can also make a Wicked Bite each time he damages a creature with his jaws Strike, in addition to the usual once per round usage for a free action. These effects last until his rage ends or he has more than 140 Hit Points, whichever comes first.",
      "rules": [
        {
          "key": "roll-option",
          "option": "reckless-abandon",
          "toggleable": true
        },
        {
          "key": "modifier",
          "selector": "attack-roll",
          "type": "status",
          "value": 2,
          "when": [
            "reckless-abandon",
            "self:effect:rage",
            {
              "lt": [
                "hp-remaining",
                141
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "modifier",
          "selector": "ac",
          "type": "status",
          "value": -2,
          "when": [
            "reckless-abandon",
            "self:effect:rage",
            {
              "lt": [
                "hp-remaining",
                141
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "modifier",
          "selector": "saving-throw",
          "type": "status",
          "value": -1,
          "when": [
            "reckless-abandon",
            "self:effect:rage",
            {
              "lt": [
                "hp-remaining",
                141
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Wicked Bite",
      "actions": "free",
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "Trigger Kharostan damages a creature with a jaws Strike\n\nFrequency once per round\n\n---\n\nEffect Kharostan's bite leaves the victim's flesh translucent around the site of the injury. He chooses one of the effects below, each of which requires the damaged creature to attempt a DC 37 Fortitude save save.\n\nIf the jaws Strike was a critical hit, the creature takes both effects, rolling the saving throw once and using the result for both effects.\n\n- Drain Blood Kharostan drinks some of the victim's blood. On a failed save, the victim is Doomed 1 and Drained 1, and Kharostan regains 20 healing HP (on a critical failure, the creature is Doomed 2 and Drained 2, and Kharostan regains 40 healing HP).\n\n- Drain Vitality (necromancy) Kharostan draws out some of the creature's vital essence. The creature becomes Enfeebled 2 for 1 hour on a failed save (or Enfeebled 3 for 1 hour on a critical failure).",
      "frequency": {
        "max": 1,
        "per": "round"
      }
    }
  ],
  "blurb": "Male urdefhan war champion"
